    "name": "Method Vocab Remix",
    "text": "3\nMethod Vocab Remix\nInstructions\n\nWrite 10 Method/Flaw/Argument Part answer choices of your own design using two random words from the Uncut Method Vocab List.\n\nEach of your answer choices should use different Uncut Method Vocab List words. No repeats.\n\nPrioritize words you know the least well. \n\nUse the hardest words.\n\nYou are allowed to change the parts of speech of words on the Uncut Method Vocab List.\n\nWrite seven Method/Flaw/Argument Part answer choices of your own design using three random words from the Uncut Method Vocab List.\n\nWrite five Method/Flaw/Argument Part answer choices of your own design using four random words from the Uncut Method Vocab List.\n\nWrite two Method/Flaw/Argument Part answer choices of your own design using five random words from the Uncut Method Vocab List.\n\nWrite one Method/Flaw/Argument Part answer choices of your own design using six random words from the Uncut Method Vocab List.\n\nSEE FULL WORKOUT DETAILS",
